      "item": "MirrorManager",
      "reviewed": false,
      "intent": "Manages mirror configuration and selection for a sysroot: caches the parsed mirrors.toml (merged with an optional custom mirrors.toml), remembers the enabled status, and locates status.json, sources.list(.d), and template.toml.",
